          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Long night-time video observation of several very bright yellow lights in the sky: probable misidentification with aircraft in approach procedure to Nice Airport.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "658ca1998e1e12a3650f644b6de102a876a988e81f45af762310b8f0a36374ae"
